# Copy to web/.env.local (git-ignored) and paste the key after the equals sign. No quotes, no spaces.
# The key is read only by the server-side function in api/chat.ts. Never put it in a VITE_ variable.
# On Vercel: add the same name in Project Settings > Environment Variables (or `npx vercel env add GEMINI_API_KEY`).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: another Gemini model name (see Google AI Studio for the current list).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
